SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/turnip,ir3,nir: Adreno 730 (SM8450) syncobj/fence fast paths, prime-core steering, autotuner lock & ir3 occupancy pass (Wave 5)

Userspace Mesa 26.3.0 optimization patch for Qualcomm Adreno 730 (`FD730`) on
Samsung Galaxy S22 (`sm8450-samsung-r0q`):

- `tu_knl_drm_msm.cc` / `tu_knl_drm.cc` / `tu_device.*`:
  * 64-slot seqlock completed-fence watermark table (`tu_q_done`), timeline &
    binary syncobj hint tables, zero-syscall `VK_SYNC_WAIT_PENDING` / completed
    timeline-semaphore wait pruning, inline stack `in_syncobjs`/`out_syncobjs`,
    and automatic Cortex-X2 prime-core thread steering (`TU_PERF_MASK`,
    respecting explicit `taskset`).
- `tu_autotune.cc`:
  * Default to `PROFILED` GMEM/SYSMEM renderpass autotuning and skip per-RP
    CS timestamp instrumentation once a renderpass history locks.
- `ir3_cse.c` / `ir3_compiler*.c` / `nir_opt_algebraic.py`:
  * Pre-RA `ir3_opt_occupancy` pass (post-`OPC_KILL` ALU sinking + register
    pressure cliff lookahead with `rpt` and subgroup guards) and balanced
    integer-exponent `fmul` trees in NIR.

Credits:
- Freedreno, Turnip, ir3 & Mesa 3D contributors (MIT License).

